ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service
Mataki na 3: Quote-First API Contract da Database Migration Proposal
Sigar: v1.0 candidate
Ranar: 12 Oktoba 2026
Matsayi: Shawara don review; ba a yi deploy, GitHub write, SQL execution ko Supabase mutation ba.
Hukuncin da aka amince da shi: Quote-first. Admin zai fara duba request, ya fayyace scope da farashi, ya aika quote ga customer, sannan customer ya karɓa kafin a fara wani payment flow. Wannan amincewa ba ta kulle farashi, currency, payment method, refund policy ko SLA ba.
1. Manufar wannan mataki
Mataki na 3 yana mayar da shawarar Quote-first zuwa API contract da migration blueprint da za a iya yin review kafin implementation. An sake karɓar source snapshots na yanzu ta hanyar read-only a GitHub domin kwatanta contract ɗin da ainihin code. Wannan audit bai canja kowane repository ko database ba.
An amince da shi
Quote-first: babu biyan kuɗi kafin a fitar da quote kuma customer ya amince da takamaiman quote version.
Quote yana haɗa farashi, currency/asset, scope, deliverables, validity da terms snapshot.
User identity ta fito daga Pi access token da backend ya tabbatar; ba daga pi_uid da browser ya tura kawai ba.
Server config ne ke ƙayyade network; request body ba zai iya canza network ba.
Payment state da request state abubuwa ne biyu daban.
Payment channels suna disabled ta default; wannan mataki ba ya aiwatar da payment processing.
Har yanzu ba a amince da shi ba
Farashi na ƙarshe da ko catalog prices za su bayyana a UI.
Ko za a karɓi NGN, Pi ko duka biyu; da valuation/conversion rules.
Lokacin kammalawa/SLA, quote validity, adadin revisions.
Cancellation, refunds, delivery acceptance, ownership/IP/source-code terms.
Pi U2A, bank transfer, ko wasu payment methods.
Admin permission names da ainihin middleware a current repository.
