2. Ƙa'idar Quote-first da lifecycle
Request lifecycle
submitted → under_review → needs_information (optional) → quote_issued → quote_accepted → queued → in_progress → delivered → completed
Hanyoyin fita: rejected, quote_declined, cancelled, ko quote_expired. Wannan proposal ne; exact enum da cancellation rules za a kulle su bayan review.
