Quote lifecycle
draft → issued → accepted | declined | expired | revoked | superseded
Quote da aka issued ba za a canja farashi ko scope dinsa a wuri guda ba.
Canjin scope ko farashi yana samar da sabon quote version; tsohon version ya kasance a tarihin audit.
Acceptance ya danganta da quote_id da version takamaimai, tare da actor da timestamp.
Server ya ƙi karɓar quote idan ya ƙare, an soke shi, an maye gurbinsa, ko ba na request ɗin customer ba ne.
Idan request ya sami quotes fiye da ɗaya, a bayyana a sarari wanne ne active; kada a bar acceptance ya zaɓi tsohon version.
3. API base da conventions
Base path da aka tsara: /api/dapp-service/v2
Matsayi: candidate contract; ba a tabbatar cewa duk routes ɗin suna cikin live API ba.
Common rules
JSON input/output; Content-Type: application/json.
User routes: Bearer Pi access token; backend ya tabbatar da token ta Pi Platform API /v2/me.
Admin routes: amfani da ALBUKHR Admin auth/role/MFA checks da ake da su. OpenAPI ya nuna placeholder auth scheme ne kawai; sai an duba ainihin middleware kafin final wiring.
network ba field ne da client zai iya saita ba. API deployment/configuration ne yake ƙayyade shi.
User endpoints suna amfani da UID da server ya tabbatar wajen authorization. Kada requestId shi kaɗai ya isa izini.
Responses su nuna safe public fields kawai; kar a fallasa internal admin notes, raw provider events ko private evidence URLs.
Existing gateway error envelope shi ne { "success": false, "error": "..." }; existing success responses suna amfani da success: true. Duk proposed endpoints za su bi wannan envelope domin compatibility, sai an amince da versioned breaking change dabam.
Yi pagination da server limits a Admin list endpoints; kada a mayar da duk records a lokaci guda.
