6. API payloads (illustrative contract)
POST /requests
{
  "projectName": "My Pi dApp",
  "serviceType": "pi_studio",
  "description": "I need help reviewing and preparing my Pi dApp.",
  "consentVersion": "v1",
  "consentAccepted": true
}
Wannan shape ne na gateway ɗin yanzu: projectName (har 120 chars), description (har 4,000 chars), serviceType (pi_studio ko developer), consentVersion (har 80 chars), da consentAccepted=true. Server ya samo applicant_pi_uid da pi_username daga Pi verification, ya sa network daga server config, ya yi insert da request_status=submitted da payment_status=unpaid. Client ba zai iya aika network, applicant_pi_uid, request_status, payment_status ko amount da zai rinjayi server ba. Kada a mayar da wannan request schema zuwa sabon sunan field ba tare da sabunta client da server tare ba.
POST /admin/requests/{requestId}/quotes
{
  "currency_or_asset": "NGN",
  "scope_summary": "Design and prepare a basic Pi dApp launch package.",
  "deliverables": [
    {"title": "Readiness review", "description": "Technical checklist and findings", "quantity": "1", "unit_amount": "100000.00"},
    {"title": "Launch guidance", "description": "Documented next steps", "quantity": "1", "unit_amount": "150000.00"}
  ],
  "out_of_scope": ["Guaranteed Pi listing or approval"],
  "valid_until": "2026-10-20T23:59:59Z",
  "revisions_included": null,
  "estimated_turnaround_days": null,
  "terms_version": "dapp-service-terms-v1"
}
Wannan misali ne na shape kawai, ba ya tabbatar da farashin, NGN, scope ko SLA. A production, amount ya zama server-validated decimal string; server ya ƙididdige total ɗin line items, kuma ya ƙi body idan total bai dace da quote lines ba. A kulle currency/asset allowlist da integer/decimal precision bayan business approval.
POST /quotes/{quoteId}/accept
Idempotency-Key: client-generated-unique-operation-id
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "version": 1,
  "accepted_terms_version": "dapp-service-terms-v1"
}
Server ya tabbatar da cewa quote version ɗin da aka nuna yana active, yana cikin validity, request ɗin na caller ne, kuma terms version ɗin da aka yarda da shi shi ne wanda aka nuna. A rubuta accepted_at, authenticated UID da quote version. Idempotency-Key header ya hana duplicate acceptance daga retries. Wannan endpoint proposed ne, ba ya cikin gateway ɗin yanzu.
