8. Database migration proposal — logical model
Wannan sashe schema proposal ne kawai. Ba a gudanar da SQL ba. Sunayen public.dapp_service_* sabbin logical objects ne; sai an sake duba current schemas da migration history kafin a tabbatar da sunayen.
Tebur
Aikinsa
Abubuwan tsaro
dapp_service_requests
Request, owner UID, network, service type, consent, request/payment statuses
Network + owner indexes; client direct write a kashe
dapp_service_request_messages
Customer-visible messages da Admin internal notes
Separate is_internal; endpoints su tace internal notes
dapp_service_quotes
Versioned price/scope/terms/expiry/acceptance
Unique (request_id, version); scope na issued quote immutable; sabon quote don canji
dapp_service_quote_items
Deliverable/line item, quantity, unit amount, line total
Server ya ƙididdige totals; FK ya tabbatar da request/network link
dapp_service_audit_events
Actor, action, before/after metadata, timestamp
Append-only contract; no client update/delete
Ƙa'idodin schema da RLS
Duk rows suna ɗauke da network (mainnet ko testnet) kuma foreign keys masu dacewa suna hana cross-network linking.
User identity ana ɗauka daga verified Pi token a API; ba a amince da browser-sent UID ba.
Enable RLS ga duk sabbin tables; ba a ba anon ko authenticated raw write access ba. Browser yana shiga ta API mai authorization checks.
service_role yana server-only; kada key ya shiga browser bundle.
Indexes a kan (network, applicant_pi_uid, created_at) da (network, request_status, created_at); quotes su sami unique (request_id, version).
Quote amounts da terms su zama snapshots masu versioning. Kada a sabunta farashi/scope na quote da customer ya riga ya karɓa.
Audit events ba za a share ko a sake rubuta su ta normal API ba.
Payment intents/events, evidence storage, bank destinations da payment RPCs an jinkirta su har sai an kulle payment methods, refunds da reconciliation. Kada a ƙirƙira su ta zato a cikin migration na wannan mataki.
9. Pi payment design boundary
Wannan phase ba ya aiwatar da payment. Idan daga baya aka amince da Pi U2A, official Pi flow yana buƙatar frontend SDK ya fara payment, sai backend ya yi server-side approval da completion. Pi ta bayyana cewa callbacks na iya maimaituwa, saboda haka idempotency da server-side payment state wajibi ne. Ana adana Server API Key a server kawai. Sources:
Pi Platform API: https://developers.minepi.com/docs/api-reference/PlatformAPI/
Pi Payments guide: https://developers.minepi.com/docs/accept-payment/Payments
Pi SDK reference: https://developers.minepi.com/docs/api-reference/SdkReference
Kada a kunna payment har sai an zaɓi methods, an kulle quote/payment currency, an rubuta refund policy, an tsara idempotency keys, an gwada reconciliation, kuma mai ALBUKHR ya bayar da izini kai tsaye.
10. Implementation sequence (ba deployment ba)
Source refresh (read-only): baseline refresh na server.js, dapp-service-v2-gateway.js, package.json, render.yaml, frontend service page/client da Admin repository an yi. Kafin implementation, sake duba current SHA da Admin auth middleware da migration history; idan SHA ya canza, re-audit kafin patch.
OpenAPI review: ya bambanta existing gateway routes (catalog/create/list) da proposed quote/Admin routes; kulle Admin auth shape bisa ainihin middleware.
Schema review: kwatanta logical tables da live Supabase schemas; rubuta SQL proposal versioned, constraints, RLS/grants, rollback da test plan.
Implementation branch proposal: additive-only routes; payment route ba ya aiki; DAPP_SERVICE_V2_ENABLED=false default.
Disposable Testnet test: bayan explicit approval kawai, yi test a database da aka ayyana musamman don QA tare da synthetic data; kada a ɗauka cewa live ALBUKHR Testnet ya dace kai tsaye. Test owner isolation, network isolation, quote races, expiry, idempotency da Admin permissions.
User/Admin UI: implement quote display/acceptance da Admin quote creation; kada a canja Dock Navigation ko shared cores sai idan an amince dabam.
Security regression: tabbatar liquidity, investment, external project, auth da identity paths ba su canza ba. Identity RPC/security issue da aka ajiye domin daga baya ba za a taɓa shi a wannan aikin ba.
Go-live approval: Mainnet migration, payment enablement da deployment suna buƙatar amincewa dabam; wannan takarda ba izinin deployment ba ce.
11. Acceptance tests kafin kowane deployment
Invalid/expired Pi token da browser-sent UID/network ba su ƙirƙiri request ko sauya ownership/network.
Customer ba ya shiga request/quote/message na wani customer; internal Admin notes na Admin ne kawai. Admin role/MFA da network scope dole su yi aiki.
Quote expired/revoked/superseded ba a karɓa; canjin scope/farashi yana ƙirƙirar sabon version; duplicate acceptance idempotent ne kuma yana rubuta actor/version/time.
Customer ba zai sa payment_status=confirmed ba. Payment endpoints ba su cikin wannan phase; Mainnet/Testnet isolation da regression tests na existing gateway modules dole su wuce.
12. Abin da ake bukata kafin Phase 4 implementation
Wannan mataki ya samar da contract proposal, ba production feature ba. Kafin Phase 4:
A amince da schema/OpenAPI, Admin role contract da request-status transitions bayan an sake tabbatar da source SHAs.
A kulle farashi/currency, quote expiry, turnaround, revisions, refunds, cancellation, delivery acceptance da IP terms.
A duba live schema/migration history, a kammala SQL + rollback plan, sannan a ba da izinin QA a database na musamman/disposable Testnet. Babu Mainnet SQL ko deployment ba tare da sabon izini ba.
